Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - The Door That Won't Open}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.05,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, then. \NBe {\i1}absolutely{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}sure to call, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.62,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Chief's super strict about time. \NYou've got the number right, yeah? {actually "other party; other side​" but idk who else it could be}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.99,0:00:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I wrote it down \Nin my notebook in the study.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.73,0:00:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This job is bigger than anything we've done before. Don't let me down!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.37,0:00:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pft. Making a phone call is nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.45,0:00:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.66,0:00:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.93,0:00:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My keys...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.59,0:01:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? They're not here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.79,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.30,0:01:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is nobody home?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.20,0:01:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.84,0:01:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.41,0:01:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The key! Open the door for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.58,0:01:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.03,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, this way!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.44,0:01:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, boy! Michael, over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.28,0:01:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.19,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There, come on now, Michael. \NIsn't it fun?
Comment: 10,0:01:40.10,0:01:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.07,0:01:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.61,0:01:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, try again. One more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.15,0:02:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch... What, no good?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.80,0:02:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! \NThe balcony window might still be open.
Comment: 10,0:02:15.15,0:02:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{just a yell}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.34,0:02:25.88,Thought,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, then. \NBe absolutely sure to call, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever. {??? idk what he means, maa maa? = more or less?} {えい、ままよ is a pretty common expression when you just resign and have to do something risky - so whatever actually fits pretty good}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.01,0:02:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A burglar!
Comment: 10,0:03:15.56,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!{??? *** iyada}　{なむさん！- another common expression basically 'god help me!' except it's the buddha, followed by comical yelling, }
Comment: 10,0:03:24.41,0:03:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{???}  {just random rambling}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.18,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, help me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.85,0:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an important assignment. \NI'm not telling you to make that call for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.49,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the desk where I work. \NYou understand, don't you? {???? hora, shigoto *** wakaru darou} {likely 仕事の机, in which case tl is accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a notebook with the phone number on top of that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The notebook with the number! \NYou know? For the phone! {shows the phone with his hand and says moshimoshi - what you say on the phone instead of hello}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.36,0:03:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the notebook first! \NThe thing I write in! {???} {I can't come up with a good alternative right now, so here's the idea of the conversation : 1. the guy demonstrates how he would usually use the phone and write things up on his notebook 2. the cat seemingly mistakes the write part (kaki kaki) as scratching (kaki kaki) and does exactly that 3. the guy went 'wait no that's what i meant! I mean the book!', the end.}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.80,0:03:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that! The notebook! \NBring me the notebook! {think he said "kaku" and that can mean both "write" and "scratch"} {more or less, yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.47,0:03:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.47,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally got through to you? That's my cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.75,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.60,0:04:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're calling me first! {probably means they couldn't wait for his call any longer}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.22,0:04:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, M-Michael, don't go there!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.70,0:04:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Kobayashi-san? \NI'm sure you were supposed to call me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.30,0:04:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What on Earth are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.40,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, bring the receiver over here! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.15,0:04:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Forget it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.55,0:04:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never relying on you again!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.10,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that? He broke the glass!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go check!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.09,0:04:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the way, Michael! \NI can't unlock it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The door's open! \NOkay, let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.68,0:05:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Finally, I'm inside!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.34,0:05:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.67,0:05:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.79,0:05:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for property damage \Nand unlawful entry!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.58,0:05:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, start walking.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, this is my house!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your excuses for the station!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, really! \NIt's my house, I'm telling you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.87,0:05:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Michael! Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.81,0:05:28.60,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.09,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.09,0:05:34.63,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.63,0:05:37.70,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.70,0:05:43.58,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!\NWhat's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - I love Grandma}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.89,0:06:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, you must be tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.36,0:06:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you some coffee.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.03,0:06:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tired, really.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.26,0:06:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But climbing up to the seventh floor \Ndoes leave me short of breath.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.57,0:06:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You walked all the way up the stairs?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.27,0:06:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Age starts with the legs, you know. \NYou've got to steel yourself every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Mom. Your coffee.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.52,0:06:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.76,0:06:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His name's Michael. \NIsn't he cute?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.99,0:06:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, Michael, \Nyou're such a spoiled baby.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you say hello too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.53,0:06:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats these days have gotten so sloppy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.37,0:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's actually pretty smart.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.14,0:06:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, cats in the old days were much sharper. {?? shan = beautiful​ From German "schön" - I'd want to go "dignified" but she says dignified directly next}　{しゃんとしてる : to be proper, etc and it is indeed derived from schön/schoen, which is a pretty cool fact I learned just now}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.11,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They had dignity.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.81,0:06:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you say that...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.55,0:07:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So how many mice \Ndoes this Michael catch in a day?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Mom, this is an apartment building!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.09,0:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have to catch any mice here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's completely useless?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.09,0:07:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael {\i1}does{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}want to go outside, \Nbut we make him put up with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.03,0:07:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no excuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.60,0:07:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not look it, \Nbut I'm very picky about cats.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.41,0:07:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Michael! \NDon't just stand there spacing out.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go catch the birds! {?} {とっ捕まえてきなさい - ordering to catch something, in this case, the birds}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.78,0:07:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The balcony is off-limits. {veranda}\NIt's much too dangerous for him. {lit: there, he often becomes about to fall}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.29,0:07:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, even sparrows think you're chicken! {are laughing at you!}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.26,0:07:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.63,0:07:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see your claws.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.57,0:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these blunt, useless claws?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show me your teeth!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.04,0:07:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, they're like rusty nails.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.84,0:07:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat's teeth should be gleaming at all times!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.84,0:07:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Mom, that's a bit much...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.71,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat is a reflection of its owner.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.84,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you as his owner\Nneed to toughen up too. {it does refer to human, but in this case it just refers to the girl}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.92,0:08:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... what? {??} {いや…え？}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.40,0:08:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't watch this anymore! \NStarting today, I'm training you properly!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.84,0:08:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This way! Come on, Michael. Now here. Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.84,0:08:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going out shopping.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.01,0:08:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{???} {honestly just sounds like grunts}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.01,0:08:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Mom and her antics...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.84,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But it helps that she'll keep Michael busy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up now!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No whining! {/begging}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.16,0:08:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.07,0:09:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! \NGet up already!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.41,0:09:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, almost there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.02,0:09:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This warehouse should do.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.52,0:09:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for some actual \Nmouse-catching practice.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Man up and deal with it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up and get in!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you want to disobey me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't come back \Nuntil you've caught a mouse!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.56,0:09:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.09,0:10:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So you like dancing too, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.33,0:10:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.03,0:10:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.04,0:10:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that! 1-2-3-4. 1-2-3-4.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.87,0:10:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{??} {just random yelling}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.08,0:10:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.30,0:10:55.12,Thought,,0,0,0,,Wow... When did those two get so close?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.12,0:10:59.86,Narrator,,0,0,0,,As it turned out, Grandma was just as much \Na dancing enthusiast as Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H090C07&}m 0 0 l 640 0 640 480 0 480{\p0}
Comment: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Operation: Save Michael}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.96,0:11:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective Yamamura!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.32,0:11:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, what's the situation?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.72,0:11:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir. The suspect is using a hostage as a shield\N and is barricaded inside that building.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, honey!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.49,0:11:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I only looked away for a moment...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say any more. \NLet's just pray he's safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.00,0:11:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the hostage's family?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.37,0:11:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.70,0:11:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, please don't worry.\N Leave everything to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.57,0:11:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Detective! Save him!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.91,0:11:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about what he might\N be going through, I... I...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.02,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.52,0:12:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So how many hostages are there? {lit: what amount of people - referring specifically to humans}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You idiots, stay put!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.03,0:12:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Make one wrong move and I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.44,0:12:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.87,0:12:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.47,0:12:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.31,0:12:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything we can to save you!{save you for sure!}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.68,0:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.84,0:12:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up! I want fifty million yen \Nin hard cash, and a car!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.80,0:12:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it ready in thirty minutes, or else...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.95,0:12:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.34,0:12:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Get back here! \NYou're my hostage, got it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.93,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So start acting like one, dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.20,0:12:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just relax!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.57,0:12:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I didn't hurt you yet, \Nyou think you can get cocky?! {??? lit: since other people are quiet, you become arrogant? - idk, maybe he means "because others always dote on you" or something?}{tl is accurate enough - this is a decently common phrasing where the idea is about taking advantage - the criminal is acting nice to the cat, which then the cat takes advantage of by acting annoying}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ugh... g-gross!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.35,0:13:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.62,0:13:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective, please hurry \Nand get the cash and the car ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.29,0:13:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, Ma'am, it's just a cat...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.29,0:13:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Just a cat," you say?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.66,0:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael is family to us!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.36,0:13:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.26,0:13:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective, the SWAT team\N is ready to move in.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.73,0:13:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.20,0:13:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch you! That does it. I'll catch you \Nand turn you into a shamisen! {?? usually this would be food but I'm not fining anything; no idea how a cat is supposed to become a lute} {accurate - back then shamisen used to to be made with cat skins}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.46,0:13:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.35,0:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{teme}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.79,0:13:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.17,0:13:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.73,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we be doing something?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.50,0:13:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, with them around...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.47,0:13:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do. {in the background you can hear the cop saying 'we must charge in!'}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.76,0:14:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What did you say?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.84,Overlap,,0,0,0,,We have our mission!{???} {我々はですね...}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.11,0:14:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting the hostage's life \Nis the police's job, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a hostage! It's a... catstage! {hitojichi (人質) = hostage, hito (人) means human - he replaces it with neko (cat)}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.81,0:14:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.86,0:14:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.29,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Just a cat"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.29,0:14:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of your bickering! \N Will this nonsense ever cease?!{How long are you going to do it?!}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.06,0:14:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I have a suggestion...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.96,0:14:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And now... Now even a cat\N looks down on me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.00,0:14:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be a complete failure\N as a human being. {ningen shikkaku - like osamu dazai's novel} {imatu: "I feel like I'm no longer human." ?}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.21,0:14:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're actually a good guy?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.55,0:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'm not letting you go anymore!} Now I'll never let you go!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.82,0:14:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quiet. What do you think they're doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.99,0:14:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down. \NMore importantly, has your wife arrived yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.30,0:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She should've been back by now.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.20,0:14:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.43,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, get ready, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.50,0:15:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I couldn't trust anyone in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.91,0:15:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're different!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.54,0:15:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I could be friends \Nwith someone like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.15,0:15:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Say... you'll run away with me, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.77,0:15:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You will, right? \NYou'll come with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.75,0:15:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.09,0:15:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The car and the cash are ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.33,0:15:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Release the hostage!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.63,0:15:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.33,0:15:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Michael back now!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.24,0:15:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer! \NCome closer and I'll skewer him!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.28,0:15:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Michael! Come, boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.76,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still! Aren't we friends? \NStop struggling!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.99,0:15:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.48,0:16:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Get him!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.53,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!{??}{とっ捕まえろ！てめえ！}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.12,0:16:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.41,0:16:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! That was scary, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Michael, go thank the detective.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.02,0:16:27.90,Thought,,0,0,0,,A cat repaying a kindness? {/returning the favor/paying back}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.74,0:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.43,0:16:53.18,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.18,0:16:55.75,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.75,0:16:59.29,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.29,0:17:02.22,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.22,0:17:04.86,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:04.47,Song,,0,0,0,,{chapter - The Ugly Kitten}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.03,0:17:14.58,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The kittens are nursing. {sucking the boob}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.58,0:17:17.04,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What adorable little kittens they are!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.04,0:17:20.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Mama Cat was overjoyed.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.98,0:17:29.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But one strange kitten was mixed in.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.32,0:17:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, why are you like that, \Nmy only ugly kitten?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.36,0:17:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugly kitten, ugly kitten!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.77,0:17:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a restless child you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.14,0:17:56.04,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The kittens were taught \Nmany things by their mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.51,0:17:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, today I'll teach you how to hunt.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.81,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First, practice walking\N without making a sound.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.91,0:18:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to walk with your claws in?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.07,0:18:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to say it?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.34,0:18:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, it's nap time.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.63,0:18:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Massie! {parody of lassie, maybe even the WMT show meiken lassie}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.83,0:18:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive, Massie!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.18,0:18:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's go, Massie! Come on!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.37,0:19:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't watch such silly shows!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.83,0:19:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ugly kitten, ugly kitten!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.87,0:19:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave him behind. {/forget about}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.36,0:19:59.07,Thought,,0,0,0,,I don't look like a cat at all. \NWho am I, really? Where is my real mother?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.07,0:20:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a cute little puppy! {inu no ko = dog's child}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.47,0:20:05.69,Thought,,0,0,0,,A dog?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.54,0:20:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you lost? Or abandoned?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.11,0:20:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how lovely! \NGrandpa, can I keep this puppy?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look very smart, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.12,0:20:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you really feel like it, \NI suppose it's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.45,0:20:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you're my dog.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.89,0:20:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you lots of things.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.50,0:20:35.64,Thought,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ugly kitten! Ugly kitten!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.20,0:20:38.07,Thought,,0,0,0,,Cute puppy!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.71,0:20:47.13,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so, the ugly kitten was named Shinnosuke,\Nand he lived happily ever after.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.35,0:20:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{??} {should be fine empty}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.09,0:20:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinnosuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you not to bark for no reason?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.38,0:21:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Shinnosuke, \Nyou're such a slow learner!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.18,0:21:17.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And they all lived happily ever after. {typical ending line in a fairy tale}
Comment: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:20.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,
